Think about it. You renamed a directory where nethack looks for it's
files. Normally the install should create it under the right name and
with the right attributes. I'm willing to bet you didn't log in as games
when you renamed that directory. If it's set to be chown <some user>
you'll now have problems. Not saying that's what would happen, but all
these things can very easily even if you get the proper name for the
directory right. 

